(FOLDER.HOME)             home folder\n$(FOLDER.DESKTOP)          desktop folder\n$(OPENCL.ACTIVATED)        whether OpenCL is activated\n$(USERNAME)                user name defined by OS\n$(NL)                      newline character\n$(JOBCODE)                 internal jobcode of current job\n"
